msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Here you can select which items should be archived. Events are archived if "
"they ended before the date given above; to-dos are archived if they were "
"finished before the date."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de Indrääg angeven, de Du archiveren wullt. Begeefnissen "
"warrt archiveert, wenn se vör dat baven angeven Datum ennen doot, Opgaven, "
"wenn se vör dat Datum heel afslaten weern."

